{
  "name": "Multi-Store Sales Consolidator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📊 MULTI-STORE SALES CONSOLIDATOR\n**What it does:** Every Monday morning it lists each store's sales spreadsheet from a Google Drive folder → reads one sheet per store → consolidates every row into one sheet → computes per-store revenue, orders, top items and week-over-week changes → an AI analyst (gpt-4o-mini) writes insights + red flags → fires a Telegram alert if revenue swings past your anomaly threshold → emails you a formatted HTML report → logs the run and pings you on Telegram.\n\n**You'll need:**\n- Google Sheets + Google Drive OAuth2 credentials\n- OpenAI API key (platform.openai.com/signup)\n- Gmail OAuth2 credential\n- A Telegram bot (telegram.org → @BotFather → /newbot) + your chat ID\n- One Google Sheet per store in a Drive folder (tab with headers: Date | Item | Qty | Revenue)\n\n**Status flow in Sheets (`Report Runs` tab):** `NEW` → `PROCESSING` → `DONE` (or `FAILED` when no store sheets are found)",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 6140,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "55ac247c-187f-4acf-bf4b-195fbb0ef6e8",
      "name": "STICKY — Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 1 — Weekly trigger + config + NEW log\nMonday 8:00 AM schedule trigger → CONFIG — Store Settings holds every editable value (owner email, sheet IDs, Drive folder, tab names, anomaly threshold) → run logged to `Report Runs` with status `NEW`.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "40e62e4c-eef0-461f-a01d-8d0744a1e94e",
