    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are a retail sales analyst writing a weekly owner briefing.\n\nWEEKLY SALES DATA (JSON):\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Compute Weekly Totals').first().json) }}\n\nRules: revenue_wow_change_pct = the overall_wow_pct value from the data (0 if missing). insights = 3-5 plain-English bullets an owner can act on. red_flags = stores or items dropping hard, zero-sales stores, or data problems (empty list if none). Never invent numbers not in the data. Output ONLY via the structured output parser.",
          "text": "=Analyze the weekly sales data above and return the structured report."
